<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Feyenoord 1 (Koeman 36 pen) Roda JC Kerkrade 0. Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 20,000.</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 2 (Burke 51, Van der Weert 66) NAC Breda 2</p>
<p>(Arnold 30, Stewart 81). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 4,000.</p>
